Statement: The grid attainable reward set
\[
C=\{(L_\theta(q))_{\theta\in\Theta}:q\text{ admissible prefix-kernel policy}\}\subset[0,T]^\Theta
\]
is product compact. Hence
\[
\mathcal R_G(\Theta)
