Write the theorem in this order: policy reduction, Borel-version lemma, density representation, weak-* compactness, product compactness/no-gap, finite-prior Bayes corollary.

Keep the theorem explicitly finite-grid and public-exogenous. Add continuum only as a separate discretization corollary.
